OL,3,AGovernment to end ban on Catholic and
OL,4,AJewish PMs' involvement in Church
OL,5,Aappointments
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has introduced a bill to
OL,8,Fend antiquated laws preventing Roman
OL,9,FCatholic or Jewish prime ministers from
OL,10,Fbeing involved in the process of making
OL,11,FChurch of England appointments.
OL,13,FIt was among the first pieces of
OL,14,Flegislation to be introduced to
OL,15,FParliament under Prime Minister Andy
OL,16,FBurnham, himself a Catholic, who has
OL,17,Fcalled the current laws "unacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
