OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGovernment to end ban on Catholic and
OL,4,AJewish PMs' involvement in Church
OL,5,Aappointments
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen appointing bishops and
OL,8,Farchbishops, the Church presents a
OL,9,Fcandidate to the prime minister who
OL,10,Fthen advises the monarch on who to
OL,11,Finstall in the role.
OL,13,FAlthough the involvement of the prime
OL,14,Fminister in this process has become
OL,15,Fmore of a formality in recent years,
OL,16,Flegislation still exists that
OL,17,Fspecifically bars Roman Catholics and
OL,18,FJews from exercising this
OL,19,Fresponsibility.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
